Provenance

This tree is an independent, from-scratch implementation of the pool ("Prime")
side of the DATUM protocol. It contains no code from Ratum
(https://github.com/iohzrd/ratum, AGPL-3.0) and was written without reference
to Ratum's source.

The wire protocol, the coinbaser v2 encoding, and the BLAKE2b header-v2 share
format were recovered by reading the client side of the protocol in these
MIT-licensed DATUM Gateway trees, which served as the specification:

  DATUM Gateway            https://github.com/OCEAN-xyz/datum_gateway
  CONVOY datum_gateway     https://github.com/CONVOYMining/datum_gateway
  FlyTheElephant1 fork     https://github.com/FlyTheElephant1/datum_gateway
  iohzrd fork              https://github.com/iohzrd/datum_gateway

  Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Bitcoin Ocean, LLC, Jason Hughes, and individual
  contributors. Licensed under the MIT License (text as above).

DATUM is a trademark of Bitcoin Ocean, LLC. This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Bitcoin Ocean, CONVOY, or Tilo Solutions, Inc.
